.Dd 0.14.0
.Dt peppy 1
.Sh NAME
.Nm peppy
.Nd operations on PEP pseudonyms
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm peppy
.Ar subcommand
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy generate-global-keys
.Nm peppy generate-global-keys

Outputs a public global key and a secret global key (use once).
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy generate-session-keys
.Nm peppy generate-session-keys
.Ar global-secret-key encryption-secret session-context

Outputs a public session key and a secret session key, derived from a global secret key with an encryption secret and session context.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy random
.Nm peppy random

Create a random new pseudonym or attribute.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encode
.Nm peppy encode
.Ar identifier

Encode an identifier into a pseudonym/attribute (or long version if > 16 bytes).
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy decode
.Nm peppy decode
.Ar hex...

Decode a pseudonym/attribute (or long version) back to its origin identifier.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encrypt
.Nm peppy encrypt
.Ar session-public-key pseudonym

Encrypt a pseudonym with a session public key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encrypt-global
.Nm peppy encrypt-global
.Ar global-public-key pseudonym

Encrypt a pseudonym with a global public key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy decrypt
.Nm peppy decrypt
.Ar session-secret-key ciphertext

Decrypt a pseudonym with a session secret key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encrypt-attribute
.Nm peppy encrypt-attribute
.Ar session-public-key attribute

Encrypt an attribute with a session public key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encrypt-attribute-global
.Nm peppy encrypt-attribute-global
.Ar global-public-key attribute

Encrypt an attribute with a global public key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy decrypt-attribute
.Nm peppy decrypt-attribute
.Ar session-secret-key ciphertext

Decrypt an attribute with a session secret key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encrypt-long-pseudonym
.Nm peppy encrypt-long-pseudonym
.Ar session-public-key pseudonym-hex...

Encrypt a long pseudonym with a session public key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy decrypt-long-pseudonym
.Nm peppy decrypt-long-pseudonym
.Ar session-secret-key ciphertext-serialized

Decrypt a long pseudonym with a session secret key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy transcrypt-long-pseudonym
.Nm peppy transcrypt-long-pseudonym
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-from session-to ciphertext-serialized

Transcrypt a long pseudonym from one domain and session to another.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy encrypt-long-attribute
.Nm peppy encrypt-long-attribute
.Ar session-public-key attribute-hex...

Encrypt a long attribute with a session public key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy decrypt-long-attribute
.Nm peppy decrypt-long-attribute
.Ar session-secret-key ciphertext-serialized

Decrypt a long attribute with a session secret key.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy transcrypt-long-attribute
.Nm peppy transcrypt-long-attribute
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-from session-to ciphertext-serialized

Transcrypt a long attribute from one domain and session to another.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy rerandomize
.Nm peppy rerandomize
.Ar ciphertext public-key

Rerandomize a ciphertext.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy transcrypt
.Nm peppy transcrypt
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-from session-to ciphertext

Transcrypt a ciphertext from one domain and session to another.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy transcrypt-from-global
.Nm peppy transcrypt-from-global
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-to ciphertext

Transcrypt a ciphertext from global to a session encryption context.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy transcrypt-to-global
.Nm peppy transcrypt-to-global
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-from ciphertext

Transcrypt a ciphertext from a session to a global encryption context.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy transcrypt-attribute
.Nm peppy transcrypt-attribute
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-from session-to ciphertext

Transcrypt an attribute from one domain and session to another.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy json-encrypt
.Nm peppy json-encrypt
.Ar pseudonym-global-secret attribute-global-secret encryption-secret session-context pseudonym-fields json-string

Encrypt a JSON object with session keys. Pseudonym fields are specified as comma-separated: field1,field2 (or empty string for none).
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy json-decrypt
.Nm peppy json-decrypt
.Ar pseudonym-global-secret attribute-global-secret encryption-secret session-context encrypted-json-string

Decrypt a JSON object with session keys.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy json-transcrypt
.Nm peppy json-transcrypt
.Ar pseudonymization-secret encryption-secret domain-from domain-to session-from session-to encrypted-json-string

Transcrypt a JSON object from one domain and session to another.
.Sh SUBCOMMAND peppy setup-distributed
.Nm peppy setup-distributed
.Ar n

Creates the secrets needed for distributed systems.
